<title>JAPAN: Keiyu -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Keiyu -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.27		vs	    8.12</p>
<p> Operating	  571    million    vs	  639    million</p>
<p> Current	    737    million    vs	  833    million</p>
<p> Net		  382    million    vs	  429    million</p>
<p> EPS		   38.13 yen	  vs	   43.41 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  8.50 yen	  vs	    6.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Keiyu Co Ltd is a used car dealer.</p>
</text>
